aring/rest/content/items/8ce0f26f7e9a4a159d9425409aa9d132/data\" class=\"ddot-round-button\">Download Advisory</a>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<h5><b>July 23, 2025</b>&nbsp;<span style=\"background-color: initial; color: currentcolor;\"> </span></h5>\n<p> </p><p>Connecticut Avenue NW Underpass Lane Closures Schedules Mon, July 28- Wed, July 30, 2025. </p>\n<a href=\"https://dcgis.maps.arcgis.com/sharing/rest/content/items/d9ed6a7847e64685b8637714d0a9ef1e/data\" class=\"ddot-round-button\">Download Advisory</a>\n\n<br>\n\n<br>\n\n<h5><b>July 7, 2025</b>&nbsp;<span style=\"background-color: initial; color: currentcolor;\"> </span></h5>\n<p> </p><p><i>Work has been postponed at this time.&nbsp;</i></p><p>Connecticut Avenue NW Streetscape Underpass Lane. Closures to Begin Monday, July 7, 2025. </p>\n<a href=\"https://dcgis.maps.arcgis.com/sharing/rest/content/items/024c6499c1a244e9bd7c9939ca85b533/data\" class=\"ddot-round-button\">Download Advisory</a>\n\n<br>\n\n<br>\n\n<h5><b>June 27, 2025</b>&nbsp;</h5><p>Connecticut Avenue NW Streetscape Underpass Lane. Closures to Begin Monday, June 30, 2025. </p>\n<a href=\"https://dcdatahub.maps.arcgis.com/sharing/rest/content/items/2a775cbb16234ffca8854a77512f272d/data\" class=\"ddot-round-button\">Download Advisory</a>\n\n\n<br>\n\n<br>\n\n<h5><b>June 9, 2025</b>&nbsp;<span style=\"background-color: initial; color: currentcolor;\"> </span></h5>\n<p> Connecticut Avenue NW Streetscape Work to Begin Monday, June 23, 2025. </p>\n<a href=\"https://dcdatahub.maps.arcgis.com/sharing/rest/content/items/fbb3fef2b74c414db982e8520038dbfa/data\" class=\"ddot-round-button\">Download Advisory</a>\n\n<br>\n\n\n<style>\n\n  .ddot-round-button {\n    background-color: #293e6b;\n    color: white;\n    padding: 10px 20px 10px 20px;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 10pt;\n    border-radius: 20px;\n    text-decoration: none!important;\n  }\n  \n  .ddot-round-button:hover {\n    background-color: #151f36;\n    color: white;\n  }\n  \n  .ddot-round-but